# A won battle from start to the next battle on the path: an archer's counter at range, the win, the summary,
# a level up, the shop, the party, the path with the next battle open; transitions caught on the way.
key A
wait 2
shot tr-title-party
key DOWN
key A
wait 3
shot tr-party-realms
wait 12
key A
wait 3
shot tr-realms-path
wait 12
key A
wait 4
shot tr-path-battle
wait 45
# The archer, ready to counter, shot at by a wolf (made an archer for the test) three cells away.
counter 2
ranged 3 4
place 3 6 6 2
place 2 3 6 0
act 3 0 0 2
wait 12
shot ranged-shot
wait 14
shot ranged-counter1
wait 10
shot ranged-counter2
wait 40
# Win: enough XP for the archer to level up.
xp 2 120
win
wait 8
shot win-falling
wait 60
key A
wait 6
shot summary-open
wait 20
shot summary-foes
wait 40
shot summary-coins
wait 60
shot summary-heroes
wait 60
shot summary-end
key A
wait 4
shot tr-shop
wait 20
key B
wait 20
key DOWN
key A
wait 20
key A
wait 20
shot path-after-win
